{
  "name": "Leads",
  "description": "Booth leads captured the moment a buyer is met",
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "log-lead",
      "label": "Log a lead I just met at the booth",
      "body": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-expo-leads` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then capture the lead I describe — name, company, country, language, contact channel and handle, product interest, and the batch it belongs to — with `met-at` set to now unless I say otherwise."
    },
    {
      "key": "update-stage",
      "label": "Update a lead's stage",
      "body": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-expo-leads` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then move the lead I name to the stage I give (new, contacted, replied, qualified, or lost). Remember a `qualified` or `lost` lead drops out of the SLA countdown."
    },
    {
      "key": "sla-at-risk",
      "label": "Which leads are about to blow the SLA window?",
      "intent": "read-only",
      "body": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-expo-leads` skill in this folder, then compute each open lead's SLA bucket from `met-at` against the settings thresholds and show me the amber and red ones first. Exclude any lead whose follow-up is already sent or whose stage is qualified or lost."
    }
  ],
  "position": 1,
  "fields": [
    {
      "slug": "name",
      "name": "Name",
      "type": "text",
      "required": true,
      "position": 0,
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "slug": "company",
      "name": "Company",
      "type": "text",
      "required": false,
      "position": 1,
      "options": {}
    },
    {
